'''Tauros''' (Japanese: '''ケンタロス''' ''Kentauros'') is a {{ct|Colorless}} Basic Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It was first released as part of the {{TCGP|Mythical Island}} expansion.

