==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unified Minds|Tauros|164}} from the {{TCG|Unified Minds}} expansion.
*'''Fighting Tackle''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Flapple|120}} and {{TCG ID|Evolving Skies|Appletun|121}}, both from the {{TCG|Evolving Skies}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.
*This card's {{TCGP|Fantastical Parade}} print features a {{Shiny}} {{p|Tauros}}.

